window.products.push({"id":774358,"name":"Gerber 30-000168 AO F.A.S.T. 3.0 Drop Point Knife, Fine Edge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N8RDglGUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com The Gerber (30-000168) AO F.A.S.T. 3.0 is a unique modified drop-point knife with a fine edge and a folding design that's smart, lightweight, and easy-to-handle. Quick-assisted opening, a dependable blade lock, and a comfortable grip all help make this knife a pleasure to handle, while a built-in carabiner clip makes it easy to attach to your bag. The knife's handle also offers an integrated bottle opener. (30-000168) AO F.A.S.T. 3.0 Drop Point Knife , Fine EdgeAt a Glance: Strong, modified drop-point blade design Strong, modified drop-point blade design Fine edge allows versatility and easy sharpening Fine edge allows versatility and easy sharpening F.A.S.T. allows quick, one-handed opening F.A.S.T. allows quick, one-handed opening Secure blade lock ensures safety Secure blade lock ensures safety Integrated carabiner clip and bottle opener Integrated carabiner clip and bottle opener Forward Action Spring Technology allows you to open the knife quickly with one hand. F.A.S.T Technology for One-Handed Opening In order for an opening mechanism to improve a knife's handling it needs to be quick, smooth, and safe, and Gerber's AO 3.0's F.A.S.T technology delivers on all three fronts. F.A.S.T stands for Forward Action Spring Technology, and it allows you to open your knife quickly using just one hand. Once open, the blade locks securely into place to protect your hand, which also allows you to put more pressure on the blade for cleaner, quicker cuts. Dependable Blade for Quick, Accurate Cuts The AO F.A.S.T. 3.0 features a strong, modified drop-point blade with a fine edge configuration that makes fast, neat cuts. Because a sharp knife is not only more effective but also safer to use, it's also worth noting that a fine-edge blade is easier to sharpen and maintain than a serrated blade. The blade measures 2.90 inches long, and it is crafted from durable stainless steel for improved edge retention and a longer tool life. Comfortable Handle with Innovative Details Sleek, convenient as well as practical, the AO F.A.S.T. 3.0 is well balanced and measures a length of 8.2 inches when locked open, and just 5.3 inches when in the closed position. The knife handle is curved to fit comfortably in your hand for improved control and comfort, and is crafted from anodized aluminum with TacHide inserts, a trademarked composite material. For added convenience, a set of thumb grooves on the back of the handle makes it easy to apply additional downward pressure to the blade when making tricky cuts. In addition, the knife's handle features an integrated carabiner clip that makes it simple to attach the knife securely to a belt loop or the outside of your pack. And onboard built-in bottle opener is sure to come in handy both at home and away from home. The AO F.A.S.T. 3.0 weighs in at just 4.91 ounces for easy transport. What's in the Box Gerber (30-000168) AO F.A.S.T. 3.0 Drop Point Knife , Fine Edge This Gerber knife features a serrated edge and an anodizedaluminum handle with TacHide inserts. From the Manufacturer Gerber 30-000168 AO F.A.S.T. 3.0 knife, fine edge. F.A.S.T. technology comes to the backpack. The AO F.A.S.T. 3.0 boasts a rugged design and easy attachment options thanks to the handy carabineer clip. Pop the top on your favorite beverage and revel at how good the modified drop point spreads peanut butter on your favorite camp site snack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N8RDglGUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GERBER","source_asin":"B0035541NO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0035541NO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0035541NO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
