window.products.push({"id":774426,"name":"Nonstick Cookware Set Non Toxic 100% PFOA Free Compatible Induction Pots and Pans Sets with Glass Lids (PACK-10-BLACK)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q1-aTgwnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥘 NON-STICK MARBLE COATING : Interior & exterior is coated by high performance non-stick marble coating makes the pans and pots easy to cook and clean. Cooking with little oil for healthy diet. Safe temperature up to 260℃. 🥘 STURDY REINFORCED DIE-CAST ALUMINUM BODY : ensures fast, even heat distribution,4mm-4.5mm thicken bottom provides a stable heat distribution during cooking, rapidly heating up, saves time and energy, 2mm thickens aluminum body appropriate weight and heat conductive can ensure uniform heat dissipation and prevent hot spots. 🥘 ERGONOMIC BAKELITE KNOB AND HANDLE : COOKLOVER's cookware sets builds with heat resistant soft touch silicone Bakelite knob and handle with beautiful wood grain design (NOT REAL WOOD). 🥘 UNIQUE TEMPERED GLASS LID : with steam vent makes viewing food easily, heat-resistant and anti-slip Ergonomic knob is nice to grip, easy to maneuver, safe and anti-scald. 🥘 COMPATIBLE INDUCTION BOTTOM: Conducts heat quickly and evenly, retain heat longer, saves energy and time which allows it to be placed evenly over heat source. Suitable for use on: Induction, gas, ceramic, electric, halogen & solid fuel cookers. (NOT OVEN SAFE)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q1-aTgwnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOKLOVER","source_asin":"B0C2T3TV48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2T3TV48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2T3TV48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":774427,"name":"Anolon Titanium 12-Inch Open Stir Fry with Helper Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fnHWRk5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description 81247 Features: -Surface material: Titanium and dupont's autograph 2. -Revolutionary titanium composite exterior means this gourmet cookware is durable, tough and easy to clean. -Professional cast stainless steel hollowcore handles are comfortable and oven safe to 500 degrees. -Restaurant tested by professional chefs, dupont's autograph 2 surpasses all other standard nonstick formulas by delivering enduring nonstick performance. -Inside and outside the pan with superior durability that stands up to the rigors of professional kitchen use. -Dishwasher safe: Yes. Color: -Black. Product Type: -Wok. Non-Stick: -Yes. Hard-Anodized: -Yes. Primary Material: -Aluminum. Helper Handle: -Yes. Dimensions: Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -5.75\". Overall Width - Side to Side: -15.25\". Overall Depth - Front to Back: -22.25\". Overall Product Weight: -5.4 lbs. Diameter: -12\". Amazon.com A rare feature among hard-anodized cookware, Anolon Titanium is actually dishwasher-safe. However, it offers cooks many advantages long before cleanup time. Constructed of extra-thick aluminum, these heavy pots and pans conduct heat quickly and uniformly (no hot spots) and won't warp. Their handsome, charcoal-gray exterior is harder than steel and resists scratching and denting. Inside, they're coated with DuPont's exceptionally durable Autograph nonstick that readily releases food. Stainless-steel handles have an attractive satin-finish. The handles are rounded for comfort, hollow to stay cool on the stovetop, oven-safe to 500 degrees F, and have hanging holes. This 12-inch stir- fry pan has a helper handle and a rounded bottom that's perfect for cooking Asian-style food. Unlike conventional hard-anodized pots and pans, this cookware is dishwasher-safe because its titanium-composite exterior is nonporous. Nevertheless, its virtue of being dishwasher-safe is not unlimited. To prevent pots and pans from discoloring in a dishwasher over time--and to prevent voiding the lifetime warranty against defects--the manufacturer's cleaning instructions about water temperature (120 to 140 degrees F) and detergent (mild, with a phosphate content less that 7-1/2 percent) must be strictly observed. As with most cookware, hand washing Anolon Titanium is the better alternative for ideal care. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fnHWRk5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anolon","source_asin":"B00005O0O1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005O0O1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005O0O1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
