window.products.push({"id":774433,"name":"Dish Soap Dispenser for Kitchen Countertop - Liquid Hand Soap Dispenser for Bathroom - Perfect for Lotion, Oils, Mouthwash - Waterproof Chalk Labels (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p8DYjTyqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHEN IT COMES TO YOUR HOME DECOR, don’t settle for a liquid hand soap dispenser that turns out to be CHEAPLY MADE and starts RUSTING as soon as it gets wet. The Premium Home Quality Glass Dishwashing Soap Dispenser or Lotion Dispenser features thick, zero-lead, PREMIUM-QUALITY GLASS and highly durable, heavy-duty food-grade STAINLESS STEEL that’s resistant to RUST and corrosion. UNLIKE OTHER Countertop HAND SOAP DISPENSERS for bathroom, shower or kitchen sinks, that are DIFFICULT TO USE and stop working, our kitchen soap dispenser is designed with a FOOD-GRADE, premium-grade stainless steel soap pump that’s specifically made to dispense the perfect amount, with ease & deliver YEARS OF QUALITY PERFORMANCE. We recommend hand-washing this liquid dispenser ’s pump. DISHWASHER-SAFE glass pump bottle dispenser! Several hand soap pump options and colors to choose from. CLASSIC, CLEAN MODERN DESIGN with CHALK LABELS! With its streamlined shape, GLEAMING stainless steel, and durable GLASS detailing, our 8.5” x 2.75” decorative hand soap dispenser adds a touch of style to any kitchen or bathroom counter decor. This EASY-TO- CLEAN glass soap dispenser with pump holds up to 16 OUNCES of hand soap, DISH SOAP, body wash, shampoo, LOTION or even ESSENTIAL OILS and mouthwash! Our 4 complementary WATERPROOF CHALK LABELS are a stylish touch to identify contents easily. GOOD TO THE EARTH – When you buy our liquid soap dispenser, you’re also investing in the PLANET’S WELLNESS. Help bring a stop to plastic soap dispenser s and lotion bottles that end up in LANDFILLS and POLLUTE the environment. Our refillable, reusable bathroom soap dispenser can be used again and again, saving the earth from EXCESS WASTE and shaving expenses off your BUDGET when you buy liquid soap in bulk and simply REFILL your clear soap dispenser for kitchen or soap dispenser for bathroom. AT PREMIUM HOME QUALITY, our name says it all – we take pride in producing the HIGHEST-QUALITY KITCHEN & BATHROOM ESSENTIAL s you’ll find on the market. As a FAMILY-OWNED, U.S.-based small business, our goal is to provide an exceptional experience for every customer. If for any reason you don’t love your farmhouse soap dispenser, please REACH OUT so we can make it right. HAPPY CUSTOMERS ARE OUR TOP PRIORITY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p8DYjTyqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Premium Home Quality","source_asin":"B075BNZHZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075BNZHZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075BNZHZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
