window.products.push({"id":774479,"name":"Vacuum Sealer, VORIAH Smart Automatic Food Vacuum Sealer Touch Screen | 9-in-1 Vacuum Mode | Detachable Washdown Design | LED Indicator | No Lid Openi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O4GCnXnYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥩【Double Pump Automatic Smart Touch】voriah food vacuum sealer adopts fully automatic smart touch screen vacuum sealing (automatic & manual), automatic lifting without opening the lid, built-in cutter, machine washable drip tray, water level sensor detection, dual pumps Commercial large suction and widened and thickened heating wire provide you with the perfect best vacuum seal and airtightness 🍰【Universal for Wet and Dry Oil Powder】Multifunctional Modes - Dry Normal/Dry Gentle/Wet Normal/Moist Gentle/Smart/Sealed/Manual/External/Stop. Different modes ensure better freshness of different foods when vacuuming, suitable for meat, seafood, fruits, vegetables, nuts, bread, jars, wine bottles, etc. Meet all your needs. 🥧【Upgraded Food Sealer】Automatically detect bags for vacuum sealing, just put the open end of the bag into the vacuum sealer, the machine will do the rest and stop sealing automatically. The vacuum food sealer is suitable for vacuum seal bags up to 11.8 inches/30cm wide. The whole machine size is 15.6*6.4*3.1 inches, the latest brushless motor is suitable for better pressure, overheating protection function and longer service life than other products 🍟【External Vacuum System】For fresh-keeping jars, crisper boxes, zipper bags, etc., the vacuum packaging machine can reduce the oxidation speed of food and prevent the wine and sauce from volatilizing too quickly. Air sealers also protect your valuables by keeping them out of air and moisture. Keeps food fresh 10 times longer compared to normal storage methods. Once sealed and frozen, your favorite foods can be preserved for up to 3 years. 🍷【2-Year Warranty & Complete Starter Kit】Passed CE-EMC/CELVD/FCC/ROHS and other ETL safety standards. voriah offers a 2-year warranty, a 30-day money-back guarantee and lifetime technical advice. All issues will be resolved within 24 hours. You will get voriah food vacuum sealer*1, user manual*1, quick guide*1, independent power cord*1, vacuum bag*10, air straw 1 set*2 heads, after-sales detailed operation tutorial*1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O4GCnXnYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"voriah","source_asin":"B0BRCPVRVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRCPVRVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRCPVRVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":774480,"name":"Quencherie Insulated Wine Tote Bag – 32oz to 48oz Travel Water Bottle Pouch Carrier Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419FXJ+CNBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Invest in a Quencherie water bottle pouch for all seasons – because hydration never stops. With its stylish geometric print design and long adjustable sling strap, this lightweight insulated water bottle bag and wine travel bag is a must-have travel accessory. Unique wine gifts for any wine lover, the Quencherie wine bottle carriers make thoughtful and fun wine drinker gifts. Great for stainless steel and plastic bottles, sports and energy drinks. Perfect for any fitness lover, adventurer or traveller wanting to increase their fluid intake. Worn over the shoulder or across the body, this elegant wine bottle carrier tote makes a chic wine carrier bag for dining out, bbqs, day trips, picnics and even cruises. Finally, an easy-wear and easy-care water bottle insulator, big enough to hold a large size bottle of water or wine! Regardless of the season, fluids lost from the body need to be frequently replaced for optimal hydration. By the time you feel thirsty, you're already dehydrated - so keep sipping and don’t get caught without liquid refreshment when you need it most. The Quencherie water bottle holders make it easy to carry your water bottle, infuser bottle, smoothie or juice flask around discreetly with ease, completely hands free! Enjoy perfectly chilled water, energy drinks or fruit infusions during those hot summer months. The water tote bags will also keep tea, coffee, soup and beverages hot When dining out, why not bring your own chilled wine along to your favorite restaurant, discreetly concealed inside your versatile insulated wine bottle tote bag! With your drink flask securely zipped up inside your Quencherie insulated water bottle carrier thirst-quenching hydration will always be just a sip away! The Quencherie wine carriers and totes come with a lifetime guarantee. If you’re not satisfied with your purchase we’ll happily provide you with a full refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419FXJ+CNBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quencherie","source_asin":"B01N09J5QZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N09J5QZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N09J5QZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
