window.products.push({"id":774593,"name":"Electric Gooseneck Kettle Temperature Control & 5 Variable Presets, Pour-Over Tea Kettle for Coffee Brewing, Stainless Steel Inner, 1200W Rapid Heatin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6173HwskjGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【±1°F Temp Control】KOIOS electric gooseneck kettle allows 1°F temp adjustment from wide range between 104 to 212°F. Built-in LCD panel indicates realtime & target water temps. 5 Temp Presets meet needs of different drink, such as Black tea, Coffee, Oolong, Green tea, White tea. 【Rapid Boiling & 2 Hours Hold Temp】With a 1200W powerful base, KOIOS electric tea kettle can boils up a FULL POT water(0.8 liters) in only 3 minutes. Select your desired temp and press \"Keep Warm\", electric kettle water boiler will heating as program till reach target temp and hold temp up to 2 hours. 【Pure Taste & Precise Pouring】Every surface that water contacts is made of food grade 304 stainless steel, without silicon, plastic or chemical linings, keeps the original taste of your coffee or tea. Swan-like leakproof spout offers a smooth and steady pour-over flow rate, perfects for manual drip brewing. 【Safety Features】Built-in STRIX NTC thermostat offers boil-dry protection and auto-off function. When kettle temp heating reaches 212°F with no water left or 2 hours Keep Warm Mode times up, gooseneck kettle will power off automatically. Insulated balance handle and steam outlet ensures a more comfortable and steady brewing prevent scald. 【Ready Rminder】: No need to watch the kettle pot boil. A beep alarm alerts you when the target temperature has been reached. 【Using Note】KOIOS gooseneck electric kettle (120V, 60Hz) ONLY applies to USA and Canada. Make sure that the lid stay closed when water kettle is heating and keep children away. You can wrap the power cord in the kettle power base to keep counter tidy. 【Resources】: ETL approved with advanced safety technology for long-lasting durability and a 1-year assurance provided by KOIOS.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6173HwskjGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOIOS","source_asin":"B0BL2KKSB4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL2KKSB4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL2KKSB4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
