window.products.push({"id":774655,"name":"Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 6 in 1 Stick Vacuum with 17Kpa Powerful Suction, Lightweight Upright Vacuum Cleaner with Multi-attachments for Home Hardwood ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GZJVn8EgS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"6-in-1 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner: With the concept of benefiting people with different shapes, this cordless vacuum is designed with rich accessories which allow you to customize the vacuum cleaner for your needs. The vacuum cleaner can easily convert the stick vacuum to an upright vacuum cleaner and 4 different kinds of handheld vacuum. Outstanding 13-23mins runtime ensures thorough cleaning all around the house. 2000mAh large capacity battery can be full charged in 4.5 hours. Flexible floor to ceiling cleaning: The cordless vacuum for floors and carpet equipped aluminium alloy tube with a long-reach hose for longer extension allowing you to clean up high and blind corners effectively, the durable strap included makes the cleaning process effortless. Motorized Floor Brush with LED lights & flexible 180° swivels sideways and 90°up and down, You can clean the dust under furniture and bed easily with this hard floor vacuum. High-efficiency Cyclone + HEPA Filtration System: It creates a high-speed rotating airflow to remove particulates from the air. Plus high-density HEPA which removes up to 99.99% of microscopic dust particles as small as 0.1 microns, this cordless sweeper vacuum provides ultimate purified air and an excellent cleaning experience for every user. HEPA is washable and recyclable. Regularly cleaning them will ensure your cordless carpet vacuum efficient. Strong Powerful Suction & Latest Brushless Motor: This household vacuum cleaners equipped with a 220W brushless motor provides up to 17Kpa powerful suction, picks up debris and dust, crumbs, pet hairs, and other messes in a minute. The pet hair vacuum have high performance on hard floors, hardwood floor, carpet, stairs and windowsills, sofa and bed, desk, curtain, and car, etc. You can adjust the 2 suction modes to meet your different cleaning needs. Buy with Confidence: The package includes a wireless vacuum cleaner, a motorized floor brush, a crevice nozzle, a brush, a aluminium alloy tube, a stretchable hose, durable strap, a adapter and a user manual to ensure the easy use of the cleaner. Besides, We also offers a worry-free warranty to make sure you buy the cordless vacuum without hesitation, if you have any questions about the vacume, please feel free to contact us, we would help you solve any problem until you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GZJVn8EgS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umoot","source_asin":"B098NQSMJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098NQSMJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098NQSMJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
