window.products.push({"id":774784,"name":"Non Slip Bathtub Mat for Kids, Fish Shape Shower Mat Non Slip with 115 Suction Cups and 30 Drain Holes Washable, for Elderly kisds Adult (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718G2u9ByIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐟【Featured Bath Mat】: The fish-shaped bath tub non-slip matt made of PVC material is not only non-slip, light, soft and wear-resistant. The textured surface is suitable for babies, and the child likes it and it is also practical. If you get the bath tub mat and find the product wrinkled, this is due to the packaging of the bath tub mat, just put the shower stall mat in boiling water and wait a few minutes to let the bath mats for bathroom tub become soft to remove the wrinkles. 🐟【Suction cup + water outlet design】: This bath mat for tub suitable for kids and elderly has 116 suction cups, which can effectively absorb the surface of your bathtub. Since the size of the suction cups of the anti slip bath mats is not uniform, you can easily do it when you want to pick up the bathtub mats. In the middle of the non slip shower mat, there are 28 water outlet holes, which makes it easy to drain water when you shower, making it more comfortable to use! 🐟【Pebble bump + texture design】: The surface of the anti slip bath mats for tub has more than 150 pebble-like bumps of different sizes. This design makes you more comfortable when using it, and the skin contact surface has a feeling of being massaged but not felt uncomfortable. Every place on the surface of the bath mat for tub for kids has fine lines, its function is to increase the friction force and make the shower matt for shower better anti-slip performance. 🐟【Two-color optional & machine washable】: We provide two colors for you to choose for this no slip bathtub mat, bright blue and restrained khaki. Our no slip shower mat are made of PVC, which normally only needs to be rinsed with water after use, which is easy to clean. Of course, you can also put the bath tub mat non slip into the washing machine for deep cleaning, the specific cleaning method is up to you. 🐟【Suitable for the crowd】: This shower mats for showers anti slip is suitable for adults, children and the elderly, comfortable and safe. non slip bathtub mat can be placed inside the bathtub or on the shower floor. Whether it's a bubble bath or a simple shower, this fish-shaped bathtub mat non slip has you covered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718G2u9ByIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jenhmus","source_asin":"B0BQ6XDL7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ6XDL7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ6XDL7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
