window.products.push({"id":774921,"name":"3D Air Mesh Bath Tub Shower Mat Non-Slip Bathtub Mat with Strong Suction Cups Extra Thick Comfortable Bathroom Mat Machine Washable Tub Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71doVC7+wDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Revolutionary Improvement In Material: Forget those cheap PVC shower mat with the pungent smell, our non-slip bathtub mats are made from high-end 3D Air Mesh material, non-toxic and no chemical odor, ultra-soft and non-slip, durable for long time service,which will bring your bathing experience to a whole new level. Double Non-Slip Designed Shower Mats: When you take a bubble bath, the PVC bath tub mat surface will get slippery, which may make you fall down. Our double sides of bath mat are used the corrugated fabric, which has the good grip. Beside 10 extra large and powerful suction cups can stay well in any smooth bathtub surface even a bubble bath. Soft And Comfortable As The Cloud: You are very tired after the whole day’s work, the hard bathtub and thin PVC tub mat cannot relieve your fatigue. Our 3D honeycomb structure bathtub mats are more comfortable than common mat, 1 inch of extra-thickness gives the comfortable support and effectively helps reduce strain. Good Drainage and Machine Washable: Our 3D air mesh anti-slip shower mat allows water & air to flow through quickly, which prevents bad odor from forming in and around your mat.It is easy to care, you don’t spend much time on caring the bath mat, just put it into the washing machine after using, then air dry naturally In a ventilated place. Get Bath Mat In Confidence: Our bath mat for tub is well made and nicely packaged.Share this relaxation with your family and friends, it is a real ideal gift for birthdays, mother’s day, anniversary, housewarmings, bridal parties, etc. If you are not satisfied for any reason, just send us e-mail and we will make it right immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71doVC7+wDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Idle Hippo","source_asin":"B0C4L4SMY5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4L4SMY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4L4SMY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
