window.products.push({"id":774958,"name":"Calphalon 3-in-1 Immersion Blender","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q9ZNsMqWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With 5 variable speeds, plus a turbo boost, the Calphalon 3-in-1 Immersion Hand Blender effortlessly whips, blends and chops while its removable guard protects your nonstick cookware. Now you can scramble eggs, whisk meringue and puree vegetables in nonstick pans without scratching them and press the stick blender turbo button for extra power when you need it most. Contoured for a comfortable grip, the 3-in-1 hand blender features an interchangeable stainless-steel blending wand, whisk and chopper for speedy and efficient preparing of silky smoothies, creamy hummus and zesty guacamole.Delivering the right texture and consistency you need, the blending wand purees foods until they are smooth and the whisk beats air into ingredients such as cream or egg whites. The chopping bowl with durable blade and lid is perfect for cutting herbs, fruits, nuts, cheese and variety of vegetables and meats in small pieces. The Calphalon immersion blender 20-oz. measuring cup measures and blends ingredients the same cup. Blending wand choper bowl chopper blade, metal whish and measuring cup are top-rack dishwasher-safe. Product Features • Removable stick blender guard allows safe blending in a nonstick pan• 5 variable speeds for blending, whisking and chopping for perfect texture and consistency• Top easy-touch turbo button provides burst of power for whipping cream or making meringue• Stainless-steel blending wand smoothly blends and purees foods• Stainless-steel whisk beats air into ingredients for fluffy results• Chopping bowl with sharp blade cuts herbs, nuts, meats and more into tiny bits• 20-oz. measuring cup measures and blends ingredients in the same cup• Blending wand choper bowl chopper blade, metal whish and measuring cup are top-rack dishwasher-safe• Calphalon immersion blender includes detailed use and care guide with recipes• 1-year limited warranty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q9ZNsMqWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B005NGQWYE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005NGQWYE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005NGQWYE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
