window.products.push({"id":774966,"name":"Chesapeake Bay Candle Tin with Double Wick Scented Candle, Sea Salt Coconut, Oval","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oZNTsLncL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Chesapeake Bay Candle Heritage collection double wick tin embraces the natural, rustic charm of the Chesapeake Bay. Like a breath of fresh air, marine sea salt, citron water and accents of dewy cyclamen invigorate the senses. The shoreline captures notes sun-kissed coconut shavings, sweet orange Blossom, musk and earthy driftwood, reminiscent of a long summer day. Includes Essential oils of pink grapefruit and orange. This double wick candle is great for indoor and outdoor use and the tin can be reused to store some of your favorite items. Drawing upon inspiration from Maryland's idyllic shoreline and inspired by local botanicals and fruits including sea grass, Magnolia, Bergamot, rosemary, sage, and more. The fragrances provide Peace and serenity emanating from the open shoreline of the Chesapeake Bay - a calmness at the sight of open water, and a peaceful tranquility that brings perspective and relaxation to your home. Discover the finely-fragranced Heritage collection, embracing the natural, rustic charm of the Chesapeake Bay and providing an array of soothing, energizing, and refreshing scents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oZNTsLncL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chesapeake Bay Candle","source_asin":"B07J6NS1HW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J6NS1HW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J6NS1HW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":774967,"name":"Prepworks by Progressive Stainless Steel Tower Grater - 9 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C4CW7KH0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description ProGrip Tower Grater. This grater features a unique pyramid shape with multipl; e stainless steel grating surface, a santoprene comfort grip handle for stability and non-skid feet to prevemt slipping on the counter. Amazon.com With the range of options and sturdy structure of the Pro Grip Ultra Tower, you can grate a mound of mozzarella in no time flat. A comfortable grip ball on top keeps the grater steady and your supporting hand away from sharp edges. In addition, this midsize grater's pyramid-style construction features medium and fine grating options (for topping off a pizza and the Caesar salad that goes with it) and a third option that is ideal for zesting citrus or shaving chocolate. The Tower's stainless-steel surface makes for fairly easy cleanup, and thanks to the grater's durable construction, you can always send it through the dishwasher. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C4CW7KH0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B083PJ99WP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-774967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083PJ99WP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083PJ99WP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
